   137	
   138	\[
   139	\begin{aligned}
   140	D\mathcal E_s(h)={}&(\theta\delta\Phi-12\delta\Phi)\Gamma_\eta
   141	 +(\theta\Phi-12\Phi)(\delta\Gamma)_\eta\\
   142	&-(\delta\Phi)_\eta(\theta\Gamma-18\Gamma)
   143	 -\Phi_\eta(\theta\delta\Gamma-18\delta\Gamma).          \tag{1.6a}
   144	\end{aligned}
   145	\]
   146	
   147	Thus differentiating already-emitted scalar coefficient rows is not a
