   190	\[
   191	 [u^j]H_a(s)=0\quad\text{whenever }s_a+6j<D.              \tag{1.11}
   192	\]
   193	
   194	For a finite jet, (1.10) is independent of unspecified higher source
   195	coefficients by causality. The derivative and its all-depth inverse are not:
