    40	## 1. Scope and the membership-direction correction
    41	
    42	The object actually banked in `SHEET6-DIRECTIONB.md` section 6 is
    43	
    44	\[
    45	 V_{\rm bank}=V_{J,D23}\cap\{B_{D21}=0\},
    46	\]
