   415	1. Ingest the 36 full $G_{23}$ coefficient arrays and bank the $B_{36}$ manifest; do not substitute `a00pp` coefficients.
   416	2. Re-certify the full-live Row-24 frontier against the banked digest and bank (2), $C_{24}$, $L_{24}$, and their hashes.
   417	3. Build the five Schur residuals once, replay the corrected reconstruction DAG, and reduce coefficientwise through \(\widetilde G_{23}\).
   418	4. Specialize and solve the sparse family quotient, returning a 36-bit verdict mask and reconstructed 81-row witnesses for every NONEMPTY component.
   419	5. On EMPTY, replicate the full family at a second good prime and start the exact characteristic-zero kill certificate. On NONEMPTY, compute projection dimensions and the corrected 30-output $e$-object on compatible D25 lifts.
