   526	## 5. The completed-ideal bridge
   527	
   528	There are two different bridge obligations: a filtered finite-depth bridge
   529	for the initial residual, and a full completed-ideal bridge for the final
   530	solution. Both live **before numerical evaluation**. After specialization to
   680	## 6. Conditional Euler/Ore lifting theorem for this campaign
   681	
   682	### Theorem 6.1 (corrected 30-stream germ certificate)
   683	
   684	Fix a coefficient field \(k\), a named radical/chart branch, `PIN42`, and all
