   847	
   848	\[
   849	                  \delta^+(N)=30N-\operatorname{rank}M^+(N).          \tag{8.2}
   850	\]
   851	
   852	The symbol \(d^+\) may be recorded only when an exact all-depth recurrence or
   853	Ore normal form proves that some integer \(N_0\) satisfies
