+Suppose instead that (e=\ell(D\mathcal H_z)<\infty). Choose a ladder depth
+(D\ge2e+1). Since the exact completion (z) belongs to (\mathcal C_D),
+
+\[
+                         e\ge f(D).                            \tag{6.3}
+\]
+
+But (2f(D)+1>D\ge2e+1), so (f(D)>e), contradicting (6.3).
