+The unconditional kill remains a finite exhaustive inconsistency:
+(V_D=\varnothing) at one depth. `xmodel/sol-algkill.md` Proposition 3.3
+explains the algebraic boundary: if the all-orders ideal contains 1, a finite
+subsystem already contains 1; asymptotic codimension or loss growth alone is
+not emptiness.
