   183	\[
   184	                         \lambda(D)\ge37,
   185	\]
   186	
   187	and (\lambda(D)) is nondecreasing. Equality (\lambda(D)=37) still needs
   188	an upper bound: at least one loss-37 operator in each class for an infimum
   189	statement, or a uniform loss-37 section for a pointwise locus statement.
   190	The binding pair supplies neither.
