+
+#### H. D45 follow-on
+
+Once D43 works, D45 is almost free: add Row 44, raise the source cap from 75
+to 77, and form a $194\times190$ derivative. It adds ten first-occurrence
+tails and ten selected equations, giving the provisional parked size
+128 variables/133 rows. D45 tests whether Row 44 kills the chosen D43 branch
