+```text
+26, 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40, 42
+```
+
+and assert that every intervening odd row vanishes for the proved grading
+reason. Retain all pristine eta components, including any component
+$a\ge30$, as an audited surplus sidecar. Do not assume `CYCLIC-30` merely
+because the old band-41 regression passed.
