+Under the 30-stream grading, these nine rungs introduce 90 first-occurrence
+tail coordinates and 89 selected scalar equations: Row 30 has nine selected
+components and the other eight rungs have ten. Thus a provisional optimized
+parked presentation grows from 28 variables/34 rows to 118 variables/123
