+\[
+                \lambda^TM_{43}=0,\qquad \lambda^Ty_1=1.       \tag{4.4}
+\]
+
+The certificate record should contain at least:
+
+```json
+{
+  "n_eval": 0,
+  "target": ["H29", 1],
+  "target_level": 42,
+  "eligible_column_rule": "global level >= n_eval",
+  "lambda_sparse": "exact indexed coefficients",
+  "lambda_times_matrix": "zero",
