+The last column follows the first-occurrence law in
+`xmodel/sol-algkill.md` §3: ordinary tails occur at Row $k+27$, and the six
+even tails occur at Row $k+32$. The generator caps are therefore 75, 77,
+and 107 respectively, interpreted as exclusive upper bounds.
