+coordinates, extra x-side directions, surplus rows, or rank-chart duplication.
+This estimate is conditional on `CYCLIC-30`/the surplus bridge,
+**CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30**, and **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE**.
